Function overloading- Multiple function withe same name but different parameters.
- Function overloaded by changing no of argument or/and type of argument.
Syntax:
class classname
{
    public:
    void demo() {code}
    void demo(variable) {code}
};
classname objectname;
objectname.demo();
objectname.demo(var);

